## A2. HACE/CLI DNA

```yaml
CliIR:
  fields: {qpid:String, hid:String, namespace:String, command:String,
           args:Vec<IRArg>, flags:Vec<String>, payload:Option<Vec<u8>>}
  methods: [arg(key)->Option<&str>, has_flag(flag)->bool]

CommandModule_trait:
  fn namespace(&self) -> &'static str
  fn handle(&self, ir:CliIR, ctx:&Context) -> Result<()>

Registry:
  HashMap<String, Box<dyn CommandModule>>
  registered: [amo, brain, comet, force, serve, hot, audit]

gate_via_me_flow:
  dispatch(ir) -> gate_via_me(ir,ctx) -> clie.parse(ParseInput) -> ValidationResult
  if Rejected -> Err(UnknownCommand)
  NOTE: clie.parse calls rr_orch which calls rr/cli -> brain NOT registered = Rejected

cmd/brain.rs_current:
  BrainArgs: {model:String, prompt:String, max_tokens:u32, temp:f32, top_p:f32}
  execute(): println!(stub) only
  BrainModule::handle(): calls execute() -- does NOT delegate to brain/cli crate

ir_builder from_brain:
  namespace: "brain"
  command: "infer"   # HARDCODED -- no subcommand routing
  all brain sub-actions collapse to single "infer"

main.rs_CRITICAL:
  type: STANDALONE_MANUAL_BYPASS
  does_NOT_use: Artisan/clap/dispatcher/Registry/gate_via_me/Clie
  flow: args[1]=="brain" -> handle_brain() -> println!(stub)
  VERDICT: entire hace/cli architecture bypassed
  GAP: two competing paths -- main.rs(stub) vs lib.rs(full dispatcher)
```

---

## A3. ME/CLIE DNA

```yaml
Clie::parse(ParseInput) -> Result<ParseOutput>

ParseInput:
  fields: [raw_command, env_ref, source, actor_id, authority_level:AuthorityLevel]
  AuthorityLevel: [User, Operator, Sovereign]

ParseOutput:
  fields: [parsed_command_ref, command_style, target_me_ref, validation_result]
  ValidationResult: [Accepted, Rejected, Pending]

orch_flow:
  1. trim raw
  2. HookBus::trigger -> Continue|Abort|UpdateCommand
  3. detect unsafe_flags [--force,--override,--seal,--sudo]
  4. rr_orch(SovereignRuntime, req, auth) -> out
  5. from_rr_response(out) -> ParseOutput

HookBus:
  hooks: &[&dyn Hook]
  brain/cli CAN inject custom hooks here

no_std: true  # brain/cli extensions must not assume std

CRITICAL_CONSTRAINT:
  rr_orch calls rr/cli families list
  "brain" not in list -> ValidationResult depends on rr_me_clie_core behavior
  RISK: Rejected for all "brain *" unless rr/cli extended
```

