## A4. BRAIN/CLI AUDIT

```yaml
path: engine/hace/brain/cli/src/
files:
  lib.rs:       0.58KB  command.rs:  1.31KB  router.rs:   0.71KB
  executor.rs:  2.10KB  model.rs:    0.98KB  lora.rs:     1.23KB
  replay.rs:    1.15KB  inspect.rs:  0.59KB  profile.rs:  0.48KB
  benchmark.rs: 0.88KB

structural_assessment:
  command.rs:   BrainAction enum {Model,Lora,Replay,Inspect,Bench,Profile} -- STRUCTURAL
  router.rs:    BrainRouter::route(BrainAction) -> executor -- STRUCTURAL
  executor.rs:  BrainExecutor / ModelExecutor / LoraExecutor / ReplayExecutor -- STUB
  model.rs:     ModelExecutor -- STUB (no GgufLoader call)
  lora.rs:      LoraExecutor -- STUB (no LroStack call)
  replay.rs:    ReplayExecutor -- STUB (no golden compare)
  inspect.rs:   STUB
  benchmark.rs: STUB

GAPS:
  G1: brain/cli NOT in hace/cli Cargo.toml -- crate unreachable from binary
  G2: brain/cli does NOT implement CommandModule trait from hace/cli
  G3: brain/cli does NOT call Clie::parse() -- no ME gate enforcement
  G4: executors do NOT call brain/runtime -> BrainKernel -> hacedle
  G5: kv.rs MISSING (in CRD spec, not created)
  G6: help.rs MISSING
  G7: Cargo.toml has NO deps on hace-brain-runtime or hace-fem-hacedle
  G8: hace brain chat NOT implemented (P0 priority)
  G9: BrainAction enum disconnected from cmd/brain.rs BrainArgs
```

