## A5. WIRING GAP MATRIX

```yaml
W-C1 CRITICAL:
  gap:   BrainModule::handle() in hace/cli does NOT call hace_brain_cli::dispatch_ir()
  fix:   impl CommandModule for BrainModule { fn handle -> hace_brain_cli::dispatch_ir(ir) }
  impact: brain/cli crate unreachable from hace binary

W-C2 CRITICAL:
  gap:   rr/cli has no CommandFamily::Brain
  fix:   add Brain enum variant + BRAIN_ACTIONS const slice
  impact: ME gate rejects all "hace brain *"

W-C3 CRITICAL:
  gap:   executor stubs do not call BrainKernel::execute()
  fix:   wire each executor -> brain/master/src/kernel/
  impact: no real inference, no real LRO, no real replay

W-C4 CRITICAL:
  gap:   main.rs manual bypass -- Artisan/dispatcher/gate_via_me all bypassed
  fix:   main.rs = Artisan::parse() + ir_builder + dispatcher
  impact: entire CLI architecture dead letter

W-H1:
  gap:   brain/cli Cargo.toml no deps on hace-brain-runtime / hace-fem-hacedle
  fix:   add path deps

W-H2:
  gap:   BrainArgs flat struct -- no subcommand routing
  fix:   BrainCommand enum with Model(ModelArgs)|Lora(LoraArgs)|Chat|Run|...

W-H3:
  gap:   hace/cli Cargo.toml no hace-brain-cli dependency
  fix:   add {path="../brain/cli"}
```

